@startuml
!include ../common/style.puml

title HANBAY HOTEL - Receptionist Use Case Diagram
left to right direction

actor Receptionist
actor Guest

rectangle "HANBAY HOTEL - FRONT DESK MANAGEMENT" {
    usecase "Login" as UC_Login
    usecase "View Reception Dashboard" as UC_Dashboard
    usecase "View Today's Arrivals" as UC_Arrivals
    usecase "View Today's Departures" as UC_Departures
    usecase "Search Booking" as UC_SearchBooking
    usecase "Verify Booking Status" as UC_VerifyBooking
    usecase "View Available Physical Rooms" as UC_ViewAvailableRooms
    usecase "Assign Physical Room" as UC_AssignRoom
    usecase "Check In Guest" as UC_CheckIn
    usecase "Check Out Guest" as UC_CheckOut
    usecase "Calculate Remaining Amount" as UC_CalculateRemaining
    usecase "Add Additional Charges" as UC_AddCharges
    usecase "Receive Remaining Payment" as UC_ReceivePayment
    usecase "Mark Room as Dirty" as UC_MarkDirty
}

Receptionist --> UC_Login
Receptionist --> UC_Dashboard
Receptionist --> UC_SearchBooking
Receptionist --> UC_AssignRoom
Receptionist --> UC_CheckIn
Receptionist --> UC_CheckOut
Receptionist --> UC_AddCharges
Receptionist --> UC_ReceivePayment

Guest --> UC_CheckIn
Guest --> UC_CheckOut
Guest --> UC_ReceivePayment

UC_Dashboard ..> UC_Arrivals : <<include>>
UC_Dashboard ..> UC_Departures : <<include>>
UC_AssignRoom ..> UC_SearchBooking : <<include>>
UC_AssignRoom ..> UC_VerifyBooking : <<include>>
UC_AssignRoom ..> UC_ViewAvailableRooms : <<include>>
UC_CheckIn ..> UC_SearchBooking : <<include>>
UC_CheckIn ..> UC_VerifyBooking : <<include>>
UC_CheckIn ..> UC_AssignRoom : <<include>>
UC_CheckOut ..> UC_SearchBooking : <<include>>
UC_CheckOut ..> UC_CalculateRemaining : <<include>>
UC_CheckOut ..> UC_MarkDirty : <<include>>
UC_AddCharges ..> UC_CheckOut : <<extend>>
UC_ReceivePayment ..> UC_CheckOut : <<extend>>

note bottom of UC_CheckIn
Only CONFIRMED bookings may be checked in.
Only AVAILABLE rooms may be assigned.
end note

@enduml
